---@field resourceIdPatterns? gcp.workloadmanager_v1.StringList The pattern to filter resources by their id For example, a pattern of ".*prod-cluster.*" will match all resources that contain "prod-cluster" in their ID.
---@field inclusionLabels? gcp.workloadmanager_v1.StringMap Labels to filter resources by. Each key-value pair in the map must exist on the resource for it to be included (e.g. VM instance labels). For example, specifying `{ "env": "prod", "database": "nosql" }` will only include resources that have labels `env=prod` and `database=nosql`.

